        "## 16.26 Summary\n",
        "\n",
        "Self-attention is powerful because every token can compare itself with every other token.  But without position information, self-attention is permutation equivariant: it does not know the original order of the rows.  Positional encoding solves this problem by injecting order into the input vectors or attention scores.\n",
